{"text": "astiNe ROOM & Winer,\n\nJEREMY WINE CO\n\nOLD VINE ZINFANDEL\nVINEYARD CUVEE | LODI APPELLATION\n\nOur 2018 Zinfandel Vineyard Cuve\u00e9 is a blend of some of our favorite\nLodi Old Vine Zinfandel fields averaging over 100 years of age. In 2018\nwe chose to pick our Zins riper and the resulting wines are big, plush and\nsuper fruit forward. From these individual vineyard lots we choose the\nvery best barrels to bottle as vineyard designates. The remaining stil\namazing and we blend these vineyards together to create a beautifu\n\nblended expression of Zinfandel.\n\nTASTING NOTES:\n\nWe blended in a scant 5% Petite Sirah to further enhance the texture and\n\nmouthfeel of an already overflowingly juicy wine. Rich and bold on the\nnose, layered with ripe plum, blackberry jam and black cherry finishing\nin soft, sweet spice and lightly toasty vanilla. On the palate, this\nZinfandel delivers a heavyweight texture of soft, broad tannins that linger\nin a mix of blueberry, smoky dark chocolate and vanilla. Aged 16 months\nin American Oak barrels\n\nTECHNICAL DETAILS:\n\nVARIETAL: 95% Zinfandel, 5% Petite Sirah\nVINTAGE: 2018\nAPPELLATION: Lodi\nALCOHOL: 15.25%\nR.S. 4g/100m|\neH: 3.79 TA: 6.5 ;\n\nDOWNTOWN - 6 WEST PINE STREET. LODI, CA 95240 | f 209.367.3773\n\nJEREMYWINECO.COM",
